  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>Girlfriends Ink exists to help overwhelmed women get intentional about their goals. Everything we create — planners, journals, digital tools, events — is designed to bring clarity, structure, and purpose to a woman’s life. Our products are bold, modern, faith-anchored, and built for women ready to level up and stay consistent.</p><p><strong>What makes us different</strong><br>We don’t just sell planners. We build lifestyle systems. Every product is tied to mindset work, purpose-driven strategy, and a community of women who are actively growing. Our brand is personal, practical, and deeply empowering — women don’t just buy our products, they join a movement.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn</strong><br>Affiliates earn a percentage of every sale made through their unique link or code. When someone shops using your code, you get paid. The more you share, the more you earn. We track everything on the backend so your commissions are always accurate and transparent.</p><p><strong>How to promote us</strong><br>Share your planner experience authentically — show how you’re using it, planning, setting goals, and staying organized. Post on social media, record unboxings, talk about your favorite features, create lifestyle content, or mention the brand in conversations. Consistency wins. Share the mission, not just the product.</p><p><strong>Other information</strong><br>We provide affiliates with branded photos, talking points, launch dates, and marketing support. Affiliates must maintain brand alignment and follow our guidelines to ensure the integrity of our mission and community. Payouts are issued monthly after sales are verified.</p></div></div>",
